">The "Little Britain" star and "Britain's Got Talent" judge has been accused of engaging in sexual misconduct and inappropriate behavior towards young women and girls. Walliams denies the allegations.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Sonam Wangchuk says he is under house arrest in Ladakh</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dc1ccca256296ae8548aae14e655239a725e075b2782896c3920766dd59f4a7e</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:17Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T07:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-sonam-wangchuk-says-he-is-under-house-arrest-in-ladakh/live-79936475--47fb6447cba6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-sonam-wangchuk-says-he-is-under-house-arrest-in-ladakh/live-79936475?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Wangchuk is among activists in Ladakh who have raised concerns about upcoming regional elections, which they say are designed to diminish voter participation as they will be held in the harsh winter period. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Darth Vader strikes back at auction as his lightsaber from two original Star Wars films reclaims the record from Luke Skywalker's prop</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5e20296f7741f5ffb7e84a4ebb2a8e72c4884d9ab94951cd38ee6eae32acca60</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:17Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T02:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/darth-vader-strikes-back-at-auction-as-his-lightsaber-from-two-original-star-wars-films-reclaims-the/a-79935960--81f69e9d2499.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/darth-vader-strikes-back-at-auction-as-his-lightsaber-from-two-original-star-wars-films-reclaims-the-record-from-luke-skywalker-s-prop/a-79935960?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Darth Vader's lightsaber sold for nearly $5 million, breaking the record set by Luke Skywalker's in July. The hilt, made from a 1950s camera flash attachment, was used in two of the original trilogy's duels.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Controversial kinship: From colonial rule to the Holocaust?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ac319428a892326a24fe01033ef0e2953cf4fda1f74391567caad1f287adfbaf</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:17Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T15:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/controversial-kinship-from-colonial-rule-to-the-holocaust/a-79902228--16129c6452e2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/controversial-kinship-from-colonial-rule-to-the-holocaust/a-79902228?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Hitler once called Eastern Europe "Germany's India." A new exhibition examines the links between colonialism and Nazism, and the bitter debate over where comparisons illuminate history and where they fall short.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>37 years after fall of Berlin Wall: How divided are Germans?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cf45f7afab90ccd470ea65b656e6f14f1b773caa16359f36c72ef96e3e015b17</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:17Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T13:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/37-years-after-fall-of-berlin-wall-how-divided-are-germans/a-79877461--471b79fce1fe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/37-years-after-fall-of-berlin-wall-how-divided-are-germans/a-79877461?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Three artists share their thoughts on the reunification of East and West Germany. How do they perceive a shared "we" and what gives them cause for optimism?</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>'Never Again!': Holocaust remembrance under pressure</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dab1ff746c1b38a606cc98487fd36a99e35fb81a8a3ba99ee9203e650c712650</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:17Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T09:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/never-again-holocaust-remembrance-under-pressure/a-79840894--861f4756e8c3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/never-again-holocaust-remembrance-under-pressure/a-79840894?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Only a few Holocaust survivors remain who can share their stories firsthand. Meanwhile, voices calling for an end to what they describe as a "cult of guilt" are growing louder. How can Holocaust remembrance survive?</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Harry Potter films turns 25 ahead of new TV series' release</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a2a28e46ef077a74a2f8358ef744babfe5f66970c08f9c8add69c1b5a8149cb7</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:17Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T15:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/harry-potter-films-turns-25-ahead-of-new-tv-series-release/a-79856130--db1dcb8d550c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/harry-potter-films-turns-25-ahead-of-new-tv-series-release/a-79856130?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">In 2001, "Harry Potter and the Sorcerer's Stone" hit cinemas and took the world by storm. Today, anticipation for the new series is high, but its creator, J.K. Rowling, remains a controversial figure.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's celebrated children's author Janosch has died</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:851f40fa533dbae624b4d74030291303fbd260df8cd22553254c9ffe0c1a06f5</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:17Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T10:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-celebrated-children-s-author-janosch-has-died/a-79851600--a3fdc8a2501b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-celebrated-children-s-author-janosch-has-died/a-79851600?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bear, Tiger and Tiger-Duck: The author and illustrator Janosch achieved world fame with his heartwarming children's figures. He died at the age of 95.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>How Berlin's Arab queers are building their community</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:20cb7b2c76d96c0828e2e1f315525f940ebf1521f71b37e47f56fe0e6f59f582</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:17Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T14:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-berlin-s-arab-queers-are-building-their-community/a-79833143--c676c7f349f7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-berlin-s-arab-queers-are-building-their-community/a-79833143?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As the co-founder of the ADIRA Drag Festival, Lebanese performance artist, drag performer, DJ and cultural organizer Hassandra has become an essential part of Berlin's queer artistic landscape.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Bollywood and the underworld — together in the spotlight?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cfd0071e533465f985333925a8b82f1b27d480fde114095b78606433291fe34a</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:17Z</updated><published>2026-10-31T07:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bollywood-and-the-underworld-together-in-the-spotlight/a-79806129--e6b957cc58ac.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bollywood-and-the-underworld-together-in-the-spotlight/a-79806129?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A wave of shootings and extortion threats has rattled India's film industry. This time, those claiming responsibility are very different from the Mumbai underworld that had Bollywood in its grip back in the 1990s.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Why malnutrition can go unnoticed, and what that means for our health</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9f5f33f62321cd1c01